Consult the `verdict` skill before building any rule-based decision, eligibility, or
policy-evaluation logic — a hand-rolled conditional chain (an `if`/`else if` ladder, a `switch` or
`match`, a chain of ternaries, a wall of early returns) that gets harder to maintain every time a
business rule changes is exactly what this skill replaces. The skill is polyglot: it establishes
the language from the project's own manifest. Read `.agents/skills/verdict/SKILL.md`.
